                    <text
                        cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                        jcr:created="{Date}2026-04-06T21:56:36.681-04:00"
                        jcr:createdBy="tadankx"
                        jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-07-22T03:59:28.219-04:00"
                        jcr:lastModifiedBy="tadankx"
                        jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                        sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                        langAttribute="none"
                        text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-26-reg&quot;>&lt;b>What the 1:1 meetings offer&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Direct discussion with AbbVie Japan Corporate Strategy Team (Business Development and Commercial Assessment teams)&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>High-level feedback on strategic fit for Japan&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Exploration of potential Japan-specific deal structures&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>A confidential follow-up process for selected opportunities&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-26-reg&quot;>&lt;b>Who should apply (must fulfill all criteria)&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Biopharma companies with marketed assets or Phase 3/Pivotal-ready assets (include Phase 2 assets for oncology) in the US, EU, or China&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Assets with or without current clinical development in Japan&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Companies open to discussing Japan-only and Japan-inclusive regional rights&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Assets aligned with AbbVie Japan priorities and therapeutic areas of interest&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-26-reg&quot;>&lt;b>AbbVie Japan partnering priorities and areas of interest&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Assets in the following therapeutic areas that compliment AbbVie Japan’s portfolio and pipeline without cannibalizing ongoing development&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Immunology&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Oncology&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Neuroscience&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Eye Care&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Hepatology&amp;nbsp; (including MASH/NASH)&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-26-reg&quot;>&lt;b>Key Evaluation Criteria&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Development stage (Late stage or&amp;nbsp; marketed outside Japan)&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Strategic fit with AbbVie’s therapeutic focus&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Clear differentiation versus existing standards of care&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Potential value and feasibility for the Japan market&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-26-reg&quot;>&lt;b>Important – non-confidential submissions only&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>All information submitted via email must be non-confidential&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Do not include data that could compromise patentability or confidentiality&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Detailed discussions will proceed under appropriate confidentiality agreements after selection&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-26-reg&quot;>&lt;b>Call to action&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:AbbVie_Japan_Partnering_Campaign@abbvie.com?subject=AbbVie%20Japan%20Partnering%20-%20Your%20name&amp;amp;body=Thank%20you%20for%20your%20interest.%20Please%20send%20items%201%20to%204%20via%20email.%201.%20Company%20name%202.%20Contact%20person%27s%20name%203.%20Program%20summary%204.%20Non-confidential%20deck%20(PDF)&quot;>here&lt;/a> to&amp;nbsp;apply for priority rolling review:&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>1st-round deadline: Aug 31, 2026 (1:1 meetings by Sep 30, 2026)&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Final-round deadline: Nov 30, 2026 (1 meetings by Dec 18, 2026)&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Selection is ongoing: applications are reviewed on a rolling basis, so act quickly for early 1:1 meeting consideration&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                        textIsRich="true"/>
