                        jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                        sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                        langAttribute="none"
                        text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-26-reg&quot;>&lt;b>Legal notice and submission terms&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Before submitting any information to AbbVie, please review the following terms carefully. If appropriate, you may wish to seek advice from qualified legal counsel regarding the protection of your intellectual property rights, including any rights available under applicable patent or copyright laws.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>By submitting information by email, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to the terms set out below.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-26-reg&quot;>&lt;b>Policy for electronic submissions&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>AbbVie accepts license candidates or research programs under the following terms and conditions.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ol>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>You represent that the information you provide via email is original to you and that you are under no contractual or legal obligation to maintain such information in confidence.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>You acknowledge that you are 18 years of age or older, and can form a legally binding contract under applicable law.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>You acknowledge that AbbVie is not receiving your information or suggestion in confidence, and that receipt of your information or suggestion does not create a confidential relationship between AbbVie and you.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>All your rights and remedies arising out of your disclosure to AbbVie are limited exclusively to rights and remedies under applicable patent law and copyright law in Japan or the United States.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ol>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-26-reg&quot;>&lt;b>Personal Information&lt;/b>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Any personal information provided to AbbVie in connection with this partnering campaign (such as your name and contact details) will be used solely for the purpose of evaluating the submitted information and communicating regarding potential partnering opportunities.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Such information may be shared within the AbbVie group and with service providers, strictly as necessary for these purposes, and will be handled in accordance with AbbVie’s Privacy Policy.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>For further information, please refer to AbbVie’s Privacy Policy:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/abbvie-com2/jp/ja/privacy.html&quot;>https://privacy.abbvie/privacy-policies.html&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                        textIsRich="true"/>
